{
  "target": {
    "module": "03-polisiya-bhs",
    "sections": {
      "section-6": {
        "en": {
          "src": "/training/audio/03-polisiya-bhs/bhs-improvement/section-6.en.57fae1b4f6a8.mp3",
          "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
          "content_hash": "57fae1b4f6a84be3e86c067b42c6133e0a9f57b1a5da67bd7dca92d78996e8ea",
          "sha256": "1a2e50d619612064f60560b4d2181a343471e234acb6dae855058b657f474432",
          "duration_seconds": 47.517,
          "timings": [
            {
              "zone": "heading",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "One efficient suggestion",
              "start_ms": 0,
              "end_ms": 2400
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "Try it: think of one thing at your own barangay health station that could be made more efficient — for example, a light left on with no one around, water dripping unnoticed, or plastics that shouldn't be used any more under DC 2021-0486.",
              "start_ms": 2700,
              "end_ms": 23660
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 1,
              "text": "Write your suggestion as one sentence you could actually say to the midwife or a fellow BHW — not just \"we should change,\" but exactly what to change and why it would help.",
              "start_ms": 23960,
              "end_ms": 37360
            },
            {
              "zone": "takeaway",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "A suggestion that's specific and has a reason is far more likely to be believed and actually carried out than a general complaint.",
              "start_ms": 37660,
              "end_ms": 47460
            }
          ]
        },
        "fil": {
          "src": "/training/audio/03-polisiya-bhs/bhs-improvement/section-6.fil.e26c2c989eca.mp3",
          "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
          "content_hash": "e26c2c989ecafb9bc1e50ed2cb702c4c18e4ea67625342df8e2b6233a72dfc34",
          "sha256": "36b51245d45b81925a46b3ae609d076a24bbc92aa865d934d65e6269d550b400",
          "duration_seconds": 53.734,
          "timings": [
            {
              "zone": "heading",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "Isang mungkahing episyente",
              "start_ms": 0,
              "end_ms": 2880
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "Subukan mo: mag-isip ng isang bagay sa iyong barangay health station na kayang gawing mas episyente — halimbawa, ang ilaw na naiiwang bukas kahit walang tao, o ang tubig na tumutulo nang hindi napapansin, o ang mga plastic na hindi na dapat ginagamit ayon sa DC 2021-0486.",
              "start_ms": 3180,
              "end_ms": 29340
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 1,
              "text": "Isulat ang mungkahi mo sa isang pangungusap na kaya mong sabihin sa midwife o sa kapwa BHW — hindi lang \"dapat magbago,\" kundi tiyak na kung ano ang babaguhin at bakit ito makakatulong.",
              "start_ms": 29640,
              "end_ms": 43880
            },
            {
              "zone": "takeaway",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "Ang mungkahing tiyak at may dahilan ang mas malamang na paniwalaan at tuluyang maisagawa kaysa sa pangkalahatang reklamo.",
              "start_ms": 44180,
              "end_ms": 53660
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  },
